; --exchange with a source:target entry whose source the commodity pool
; does not know leaves a balance unconverted: FAKE names no commodity,
; so the entry matches none of the balance's components.  An unknown
; source used to lift the entry's restriction and convert every
; component of the balance to EUR.

2024/01/01 Test
    Expenses:Food    $100.00
    Expenses:Drink   50 EUR
    Assets:Cash

P 2024/01/01 $ 0.90 EUR

test bal --exchange FAKE:EUR
            $-100.00
          -50.00 EUR  Assets:Cash
             $100.00
           50.00 EUR  Expenses
           50.00 EUR    Drink
             $100.00    Food
--------------------
                   0
end test
